        "description": "- AUTH_MODE_CLOUD: WorkOS SSO (Cloud edition)\n - AUTH_MODE_SELF_HOSTED: Email/password + magic link (Self-hosted)",
        "title": "AuthMode represents the authentication mode for the instance"
      },
